<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγ-κᾰλύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover</i> or <i>veil completely</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν δὲ νεφέεσσι κάλυψε γαῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.293
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τι χρόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					872
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				452d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀλήθειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.Alch.
					p.70
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαλύψαντές μου τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1816.19
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ συγκεκαλυμμένος
				πατήρ</span>, with reference to a well-known fallacy (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαλύπτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάγει συγκεκαλυμμένην</span>
			<i>muffled up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Su.</u>
				39
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαλύψασθαι</span>, <i>wrap oneself up,
				cover one's face</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.7.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψασθαι τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).126.6
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος συγκαλύψας ἀχλύϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.59b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
